docs {
  # Creates a new Kubernetes credentials configuration

  **Deprecated**

  The body must not provide an ID as it will be automatically assigned by the Dynatrace server.

  **Auth:** Api-Token only (OAuth not supported by this endpoint). Uses `{{DT_API_TOKEN}}`.

  **API token scopes:** WriteConfig
